          "author": "Sarah Walden",
          "description": "These delightful books build fun foundations for life-long learning by explaining big ideas to little people!  Using simple language to explain complicated ideas, each book takes the core questions that relate to each subject and provides answers that make sense to young children. Immersive soundscapes support the non-fiction narratives, ensuring our approach feels fresh and different! Includes: What Is Philosophy? What Is Money? What Is Art? What Is Music?",
